        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-CLAYSCAPE-PAGETURNER-96-100.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-PAGETURNER-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH96-PAGINATION-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH97-HAPTIC-CURL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH98-RENDERMAN-RIB-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH99-READ-ISOLATION-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH100-GRAND-CENTURY-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-PAGETURNER-PROOF-WITNESS PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PAGETURNER.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-PAGETURNER.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH96-PAGINATION-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH97-HAPTIC-CURL-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH98-RENDERMAN-RIB-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH99-READ-ISOLATION-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH100-GRAND-CENTURY-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-PAGETURNER-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-PAGETURNER-PROOF-WITNESS.
